<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy 10-yr BTP bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy 10-yr BTP bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a third tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 7.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   November 1, 2006    previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	  6.24 pct vs	6.78 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield	7.22 pct vs	7.77 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  104.60    vs    100.80</p>
<p> Bids		 3.387 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   1.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The previous auction was of a first tranche of the 10-year, 7.75 percent BTP on October 30.</p>
</text>
